<description>&lt;p&gt;Thailand and Cambodia have resumed border clashes ahead of talks, while the Thai Home Ministry is deploying AI-powered surveillance systems to target smuggling syndicates and strengthen border control. In Chiang Rai police seized 350 kg of meth hidden in a water truck, and floods have killed 71 people and affected nearly 908,000 households across Thailand. Prime Minister Hun Manet has publicly challenged opposition figure Um Sam An to prove border claims, and a Filipina trafficking victim with stage IV breast cancer was repatriated from Thailand. The conflict caused 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Devdiscourse&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxPUVBsR3hoQzdFSFZHa1lweW1lQldleUlzMkVwRnBuWnlObUI3VGw2YngzM3JtaFF0ak5KN3F4YjBjVDBfUDRJLWk4VHRMTzdTRDZ0ZkFrRDFkTmU1djlUMXdHbTRKbWFLOUN6dks0b2xZN3BCXzc2Q1N6VWdOelFFczJR?oc=5&quot;&gt;China Daily Global Edition&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxPS3NVRWMwZUFxOGJ4ZGdfSkt0eU5HZUFuNXQzYzhWMkw0MGVpNGJXSFFwTGp2cndsS25JaVUteml6LUh3S1daVFE5V1VUMDFjUVl6THNkd2Y2Nk10Z2dIMXlzNEc4ZC1lZy1OYmFDTkFiT0NRVnV5SGtISTdfdzduei1FWmxqbWdaeE9vblhTQWNQQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bol News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxOQzluT0ZuZ2o4aFdkSTgzaG9OLTdqWGpMZjBmRzlHbDRsX3l1eTd1U3kxM0MwUkdvVWRMMUdTQ3VWc1Nza1daY3NqMGR2bkdaeUZhV0w3MkloYW1wbkdRQWNJYWVZako4bU92ZW9iSU5SbXg1ZUhSTmpWSDh0VTkwU1c5MVN0bXVLZFp2cnBSQlBYZDY0alROZ3RCSzRDbF9pMWo3U1oyNmF0VjlQZTJrVE5EMk4xMjBDUTBNVy1xbw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Vibes&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxPSkZ0UVdYYms1aVNlNlpmVGRYel8xOGFjTzIwb05fZFZmYkVwTGxNR1VGUy1JZzEwYmE3eElwVklDNDVIUDlYb1ljNDI1eEMzTGZYeHJ5Uzc5OUZneXRyRE14a3hxUmVJOFlVUGx